The original gemini-obsidian project is a MCP extension for Google Gemini CLI 
that enables Obsidian vault interaction through semantic search and note management.

This adaptation includes:
- Migration from Gemini CLI to Opencode
- Shortened command syntax
- LanceDB integration for vector search
- Automatic note indexing
- Predefined templates for Azure DevOps
- Deploy validation with Azure IDs
- Obsidian App integration
- Windows installer
- Multi-platform support

